{"id":"torrey:holy-spirit-the-personality-of","source":"torrey","name":"Holy Spirit, The Personality Of","slug":"holy-spirit-the-personality-of","seeAlso":[],"entries":[{"text":"He creates and gives life — Job 33:4.","refs":[["Job",33,4,33,4]]},{"text":"He appoints and commissions ministers — Isa 48:16; Ac 13:2; 20:28.","refs":[["Isa",48,16,48,16],["Acts",13,2,13,2],["Acts",20,28,20,28]]},{"text":"He directs ministers where to preach — Ac 8:29; 10:19,20.","refs":[["Acts",8,29,8,29],["Acts",10,19,10,19],["Acts",10,20,10,20]]},{"text":"He directs ministers where not to preach — Ac 16:6,7.","refs":[["Acts",16,6,16,6],["Acts",16,7,16,7]]},{"text":"He instructs ministers what to preach — 1Co 2:13.","refs":[["1Cor",2,13,2,13]]},{"text":"He spoke in, and by, the prophets — Ac 1:16; 1Pe 1:11,12; 2Pe 1:21.","refs":[["Acts",1,16,1,16],["1Pet",1,11,1,11],["1Pet",1,12,1,12],["2Pet",1,21,1,21]]},{"text":"He strives with sinners — Ge 6:3.","refs":[["Gen",6,3,6,3]]},{"text":"He reproves — Joh 16:8.","refs":[["John",16,8,16,8]]},{"text":"He comforts — Ac 9:31.","refs":[["Acts",9,31,9,31]]},{"text":"He helps our infirmities — Ro 8:26.","refs":[["Rom",8,26,8,26]]},{"text":"He teaches — Joh 14:26; 1Co 12:3.","refs":[["John",14,26,14,26],["1Cor",12,3,12,3]]},{"text":"He guides — Joh 16:13.","refs":[["John",16,13,16,13]]},{"text":"He sanctifies — Ro 15:16; 1Co 6:11.","refs":[["Rom",15,16,15,16],["1Cor",6,11,6,11]]},{"text":"He testifies of Christ — Joh 15:26.","refs":[["John",15,26,15,26]]},{"text":"He glorifies Christ — Joh 16:14.","refs":[["John",16,14,16,14]]},{"text":"He has a power of his own — Ro 15:13.","refs":[["Rom",15,13,15,13]]},{"text":"He searches all things — Ro 11:33,34; 1Co 2:10,11.","refs":[["Rom",11,33,11,33],["Rom",11,34,11,34],["1Cor",2,10,2,10],["1Cor",2,11,2,11]]},{"text":"He works according to his own will — 1Co 12:11.","refs":[["1Cor",12,11,12,11]]},{"text":"He dwells with saints — Joh 14:17.","refs":[["John",14,17,14,17]]},{"text":"He can be grieved — Eph 4:30.","refs":[["Eph",4,30,4,30]]},{"text":"He can be vexed — Isa 63:10.","refs":[["Isa",63,10,63,10]]},{"text":"He can be resisted — Ac 7:51.","refs":[["Acts",7,51,7,51]]},{"text":"He can be tempted — Ac 5:9.","refs":[["Acts",5,9,5,9]]}],"refCount":36}
